        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="1. Client submits complaint to API Gateway&#xa;2. Ingest Lambda generates ID, stores raw payload, and creates initial DynamoDB state&#xa;3. Ingest publishes `ComplaintReceived`&#xa;4. Analyze Lambda reads S3, calls Bedrock, and updates the complaint state&#xa;5. Analyze publishes `ComplaintAnalyzed`&#xa;6. Action Lambda persists simulated action outcome&#xa;7. Client queries `GET /complaints/{complaintId}` via Query Lambda" vertex="1">
